  "text": "Cursor of CAD: An AI-Native Agentic Engine for CNC Geometry\n\nRaja Muhammad Ali Asghar Rawalpindi, Pakistan Votes: 1Views: 842 Robotics & Automation May 8, 2026\n\nThe \"Click-and-Drag\" Bottleneck\n\nIn the modern CNC and manufacturing industry, the design phase remains the most significant bottleneck. Operators still rely on manual vector tracing and legacy CAD software that requires intensive human labor to convert raw concepts into production-ready files. For small-scale workshops and independent designers, this manual \"click-and-drag\" workflow is inefficient, prone to human error, and limits the ability to scale.\n\nAn Agentic CAD Environment\n\nCursor of CAD (powered by the Ali CNC Trace It protocol) is an AI-native geometric engine that replaces manual drawing with an agentic, natural-language-driven workflow. Inspired by the efficiency of modern AI coding environments, this project introduces a \"Geometric Protocol\" that interprets design intent directly into high-precision vectors.\n\nKey features include:\n\nPrompt-to-Geometry Engine: Bypassing traditional toolbars, the system uses a Python-based logic to generate complex 2D and 2.5D vectors from natural language descriptions or low-resolution image inputs.\n\n1mm Precision Guarantee: Built specifically for the manufacturing floor, the engine operates on a strict millimeter-standard, ensuring that AI-generated paths are not just \"visuals\" but are mathematically accurate for G-code toolpathing.\n\nInfinite Resolution Tracing: The engine uses a proprietary \"tracing\" logic that understands the structural intent of a design, allowing it to reconstruct clean, sharp geometry from imperfect source files—a task that typically takes hours of manual \"node editing.\"\n\nCross-Platform Integration: Designed to bridge the gap between mobile and industrial hardware, the system integrates with cloud APIs like Onshape to allow for 3D mesh refinement on mobile devices, enabling design-on-the-go for shop operators.\n\nMarket Impact & Sustainability\n\nBy reducing the design-to-production time by up to 90%, Cursor of CAD democratizes high-end manufacturing. It allows solo operators and small CNC shops to compete with large-scale factories by drastically lowering the technical barrier to entry. This engine isn't just a tool; it is a fundamental shift from \"drawing\" geometry to \"architecting\" it through AI collaboration.\n\nLike this entry?\n\nVoting is closed!\n\nAbout the Entrant\n\nName: Raja Muhammad Ali Asghar\n\nType of entry: individual\n\nSoftware used for this entry: Nodejs , ai apis\n\nPatent status: none\n\nLoad Comments\n\nGold Sponsor\n\nView Entries by\n\nContest Category\n\nAerospace & Defense\n\nAutomotive/​​​Transportation\n\nElectronics\n\nEnergy, Power & Propulsion\n\nManufacturing & Materials\n\nMedical\n\nRobotics & Automation\n\nAlso\n\nTag Cloud\n\n2026 Entrants\n\nNumber of Votes\n\nNumber of Page Views\n\nView All Entries\n\n2025 Contest Results\n\nGrand Prize & Category Winners\n\nTop 100 Entries\n\nBrowse All the Entries\n\nFinal Voting Scoreboard\n\nMeet the Judges",
